CONFIGURE NETFLOW ANALYZER:
Step 1: Config and verify netflow:

@R1
conf t
flow record ENCOROUT
 description OUTBOUND
 match ipv4 destination address
 match transport destination-port
 collect counter bytes
 collect counter packets
end

Step 2: Create Flow Exporter to NetflowCollector:
@R1
conf t
flow exporter ENCOREXPORT
 destination 192.168.102.1
 export-protocol netflow-v9
 transport udp 9999
end

Step 3: Create flow monitor and association:
config t
flow monitor ENCORMONITORin
 record netflow ipv4 original-input
 cache timeout active 30
 exporter ENCOREXPORT
exit
flow monitor ENCORMONITORout
 record ENCOROUT
 cache timeout active 30
 exporter ENCOREXPORT
end

Step 4: Interface Flow Caching:
@R1:
conf t
int gi 2
ip flow monitor ENCORMONITORin input
ip flow monitor ENCORMONITORout output






